1
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:06,397
(Bernadette:)And the next wedding gift is...

2
00:00:06,573 --> 00:00:09,773
(Bernadette:)...a gravy boat.
- Oh, one gravy boat.

3
00:00:09,943 --> 00:00:12,933
(Amy:)That's from Sheldon.
He told me he had it engraved.

4
00:00:13,113 --> 00:00:16,843
"In the event of a divorce
please return to Sheldon Cooper."

5
00:00:18,284 --> 00:00:20,774
(Penny:)One inappropriate...

6
00:00:20,954 --> 00:00:24,084
...yet-l-wish-l-thought-of-that
gravy boat.

7
00:00:24,257 --> 00:00:27,857
When I get married, I'm gonna register
at the UCLA cadaver lab.

8
00:00:28,228 --> 00:00:29,288
(Penny:)Ew. Why?

9
00:00:29,462 --> 00:00:31,722
Because I've always wanted
a whole human skeleton...

10
00:00:31,898 --> 00:00:33,158
(Amy:)...and they are really spendy.

11
00:00:34,501 --> 00:00:37,231
(Bernadette:)You actually see you and Sheldon
getting married someday?

12
00:00:37,637 --> 00:00:40,767
(Amy:)Not just someday,
in exactly four years.

13
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,570
(Amy:)But don't tell Sheldon,
he's still a flight risk.

14
00:00:45,078 --> 00:00:46,308
(Bernadette:)What about you, Penny?

15
00:00:46,813 --> 00:00:47,943
(Penny:)What about me, what?

16
00:00:48,114 --> 00:00:51,104
(Bernadette:)Do you think you and Leonard
might ever get married?

17
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:56,814
(Penny:)Oh, well, you know, Leonard is great.

18
00:00:58,024 --> 00:00:59,784
(Bernadette:)But do you think
you'll ever get married?

19
00:00:59,959 --> 00:01:02,019
(Penny:)He's a sweetie.

